{
  "name": "florence-shopper-rufus-extract",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## florence-shopper-rufus-extract\n\n**Skill:** /shopper-interrogator (Skill 3)\n**Trigger:** POST webhook with `x-florence-secret` header\n\n**Input shape:**\n```json\n{ \"asin\": \"B07XYZ4231\" }\n```\n\n**Output shape:**\n```json\n{ \"asin\": \"B07XYZ4231\", \"questions\": [\"Does it work for...?\", \"How big is...?\"] }\n```\n\n**External dependency:** Amazon Rufus MCP. Replace the URL in *Call Rufus MCP* with your endpoint. Latency target <30s.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0a000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-160, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "florence/shopper/rufus-extract",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "florence-shopper-rufus-extract",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Florence — Webhook Secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_AMAZON_RUFUS_MCP_URL/questions",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ asin: $json.body.asin, limit: 30 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "0a000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Call Rufus MCP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [540, 300],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "asin-out",
              "name": "asin",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.asin }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "questions-out",
              "name": "questions",
              "value": "={{ ($json.questions || []).map(q => q.text || q) }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Shape Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [840, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [1140, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call Rufus MCP", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Call Rufus MCP": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Shape Output", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Shape Output": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "florence" },
    { "name": "skill-3-shopper" },
    { "name": "p0" }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "templateCreatedBy": "florence",
    "templateVersion": "0.1.0"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
